                <pb facs="0952" n="832" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg832"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Eddy to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November 12,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Eddy reports that the commercial agent at Vladivostok has informed him that
                    the restriction against the Japanese at that place has been removed.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
